@startuml creator_default_entitlement
title Creator default entitlement configuration
component "config/index.ts\nIFR threshold / creator channel\nserver-only creator credential" as CreatorConfig
component "entitlement.ts\nDEFAULT_ENTITLEMENT" as CreatorPolicy
component "access.ts\nGET /access/check" as CreatorAccess
component "entitlement.ts\ncheckEntitlement" as CreatorCheck
component "lock-checker.ts\nisLocked" as CreatorLock
component "IFRLock contract" as CreatorContract
component "auth.ts callback\nfresh viewer OAuth client" as CreatorCallback
component "Google channels.list(mine=true)" as VisitorIdentity
component "session-store.ts\nvisitor tokens + verified channel ID" as CreatorSession
component "youtube-checker.ts\nisMember(visitor ID, creator ID)" as MembershipCheck
component "separate creator OAuth client" as CreatorOAuth
component "Google members.list" as MembersAPI
CreatorConfig --> CreatorPolicy : validated decimal string; default 1000
CreatorPolicy --> CreatorAccess : shared startup policy
CreatorAccess --> CreatorCheck : authenticated wallet + stored visitor ID
CreatorCheck --> CreatorLock : IFR condition threshold string
CreatorLock --> CreatorContract : parseUnits(value, 9) bigint
CreatorCallback --> VisitorIdentity : readonly viewer authority; exactly one channel
VisitorIdentity --> CreatorSession : atomically store tokens + provider ID
CreatorSession --> CreatorAccess : sid lookup; one-hour TTL
CreatorConfig --> CreatorPolicy : youtube_member.channelId
CreatorCheck --> MembershipCheck : verified visitor ID + policy creator
CreatorConfig --> CreatorOAuth : optional creator refresh credential
MembershipCheck --> CreatorOAuth : configured creator only
CreatorOAuth --> MembersAPI : all_current; visitor ID filter; maxResults 1
MembersAPI --> MembershipCheck : exact creatorChannelId + memberDetails.channelId
note right of CreatorCheck
  OR / AND logic and IFR arithmetic retained.
  Explicit policies retain their own thresholds and logic.
  Missing creator/session/policy proof denies membership.
end note
@enduml

